 "Clic a clic, las horas por edad. A los 13-18 años se necesitan entre 8 y 10 horas: muchos adolescentes duermen menos de 7 entre semana.": "Click by click, the hours by age. At 13-18 you need between 8 and 10 hours: many teenagers sleep less than 7 on weeknights.",
