 "<div style=\"font-family:'Merriweather', serif;font-size:34px;color:#f6e7b0\">22:15</div><div>Leer un rato</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'Merriweather', serif;font-size:34px;color:#f6e7b0\">22:15</div><div>Read for a while</div>",
 "<div style=\"font-family:'Merriweather', serif;font-size:34px;color:#f6e7b0\">22:30</div><div>Luz apagada</div>": "<div style=\"font-family:'Merriweather', serif;font-size:34px;color:#f6e7b0\">22:30</div><div>Lights out</div>",
