 "Portada en forma de lámina antigua: la columna es un dibujo SVG, vértebra a vértebra, que aparece despacio. Pregunta: ¿quién ha tenido alguna vez dolor de espalda?": "Cover styled as an old anatomical plate: the spine is an SVG drawing, vertebra by vertebra, that appears slowly. Question: who has ever had back pain?",
 "LÁMINA I · EDUCACIÓN FÍSICA Y SALUD": "PLATE I · PHYSICAL EDUCATION AND HEALTH",
 "Una espalda<br>para toda la vida": "A back<br>for life",
 "Postura, mochila y movimiento: pequeños gestos que tu columna agradecerá dentro de treinta años": "Posture, backpack and movement: small habits your spine will thank you for in thirty years",
 "Columna vertebral vista de lado, con sus curvas": "Spine seen from the side, with its curves",
 "Fig. 1 — Columna vertebral, vista lateral": "Fig. 1 — Spine, side view",
 "Cada clic dibuja un rótulo con su línea. Las curvas no son un defecto: funcionan como un muelle. El problema es exagerarlas o aplanarlas durante horas.": "Each click draws a label with its line. The curves are not a defect: they work like a spring. The problem is exaggerating or flattening them for hours.",
 "Tres curvas que hacen de muelle": "Three curves that act as a spring",
 "Columna vertebral con sus regiones": "Spine with its regions",
 "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Cervical</span><br>7 vértebras: sujetan la cabeza": "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Cervical</span><br>7 vertebrae: they hold up the head",
 "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Dorsal</span><br>12 vértebras, unidas a las costillas": "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Thoracic</span><br>12 vertebrae, joined to the ribs",
 "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Lumbar</span><br>5 vértebras: las que más carga soportan": "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Lumbar</span><br>5 vertebrae: they bear the most load",
 "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Sacro y cóccix</span><br>La base, unida a la pelvis": "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:28px;font-style:italic;color:#a8432f\">Sacrum and coccyx</span><br>The base, joined to the pelvis",
 "Las curvas reparten el peso y amortiguan cada paso y cada salto.": "The curves spread the weight and cushion every step and every jump.",
