 "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:27px;color:#5a3e2b\">Pantalla a la altura de los ojos</span><br><span style=\"color:#8a7158\">sin bajar la cabeza</span>": "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:27px;color:#5a3e2b\">Screen at eye level</span><br><span style=\"color:#8a7158\">without looking down</span>",
 "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:27px;color:#5a3e2b\">Cambia de postura</span><br><span style=\"color:#8a7158\">y levántate cada 30 o 45 minutos</span>": "<span style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display', serif;font-size:27px;color:#5a3e2b\">Change position</span><br><span style=\"color:#8a7158\">and stand up every 30 or 45 minutes</span>",
 "Para hacer en clase, de pie junto a la mesa. Pulsa la cuenta atrás cuando estén todos preparados: 20 segundos por ejercicio, respirando despacio.": "To do in class, standing by the desk. Click the countdown when everyone is ready: 20 seconds per exercise, breathing slowly.",
